sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as App (text/voice)
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant AE as Astrology Engine
    participant M as Memory (pgvector)
    participant S as Safety Ladder
    participant C as Claude API
    U->>App: "Should I sign the lease this week?" (any of 8 languages)
    App->>O: transcript + language tag
    O->>S: L1 screen (self-harm / medical / legal / financial-risk)
    S-->>O: clear (or escalate L2–L5)
    par retrieve context
        O->>AE: current transits, dasha, muhurta windows for user chart
        AE-->>O: typed facts with IDs
        O->>M: top-k relevant memories (visibility-gated)
        M-->>O: "moving flat, budget worry (June)"
    end
    O->>C: system prompt + facts + memories + conversation state
    C-->>O: reflective guidance citing fact-IDs
    O->>O: lint: every astrological claim cites a fact-ID
    O-->>App: reply + "why this guidance" + memory chip suggestion
    App-->>U: text + optional Tara voice + avatar state "thoughtful"
    U->>App: accepts memory chip
    App->>M: store consented memory (type: decision-context)
